    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "National changes to the 2020 census, such as response forms going online, cuts to the Census Bureau budget, and the possible addition of a citizenship question, complicate efforts to count California's Bay Area.  Locally, census officials must contend with challenges to enumerate many Bay Area residents who live in unconventional housing and/or are immigrants.",
